1
00:00:00,413 --> 00:00:02,483
(echoing):
To Mars!

2
00:00:04,784 --> 00:00:07,354
(Sheldon:)Afterwards,
Leonard blew his nose,

3
00:00:07,354 --> 00:00:09,684
(Sheldon:)and pie came out.

4
00:00:12,826 --> 00:00:15,526
LEONARD:
Right there, right there,

5
00:00:15,529 --> 00:00:17,259
Oh, God, that's it!

6
00:00:20,633 --> 00:00:22,463
(Penny:)How did you get paint
in your eye?

7
00:00:22,469 --> 00:00:26,169
(Leonard:)Because you wouldn't let me
wear safety goggles!

8
00:00:29,676 --> 00:00:31,806
(sighs heavily)
This looks terrible.

9
00:00:31,812 --> 00:00:33,042
She-she's gonna know.

10
00:00:33,047 --> 00:00:34,077
(Howard:)It's fine.

11
00:00:34,081 --> 00:00:35,681
(Howard:)You just need two more nails.

12
00:00:35,683 --> 00:00:36,683
(Raj:)Okay, where should I put them?

13
00:00:36,684 --> 00:00:38,014
(Howard:)In Emily's eyes.

14
00:00:40,820 --> 00:00:42,190
(Raj:)You're not helping.

15
00:00:42,189 --> 00:00:44,859
(Bernadette:)Well, maybe this is
what you get for snooping.

16
00:00:44,859 --> 00:00:46,389
You know, it-it's bad enough
that I have to deal with this...

17
00:00:46,393 --> 00:00:48,163
EMILY:
Raj? I'm back.
(door closes)

18
00:00:48,162 --> 00:00:50,232
(Raj:)Oh, no.

19
00:00:50,830 --> 00:00:52,560
(Leonard:)Hey.
Hi.

20
00:00:52,566 --> 00:00:55,866
(stammering):
How was the hospital?

21
00:00:55,870 --> 00:00:57,400
(Amy:)Fine.

22
00:00:57,404 --> 00:01:00,024
(Emily:)What were you doing in there?

